transaction\_id & VARCHAR(100) & UNIQUE & Gateway transaction token. \\ \hline
created\_at & DATETIME & NOT NULL & Initiation timestamp. \\ \hline
updated\_at & DATETIME & NULLABLE & Status update timestamp. \\ \hline
